---
import SeminaireLayout from '../layouts/SeminaireLayout.astro';
---

<SeminaireLayout>

  <!-- ─── Section 01: The Premise ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--premise">

    <div class="sm-hero-image">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/seminaire/seminaire-hero.jpg"
        alt="Fondation CAB, Saint-Paul-de-Vence"
        loading="lazy"
        class="sm-img"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="sm-container">
      <p class="sm-eyebrow">Saint-Paul-de-Vence</p>

      <h1 class="sm-h1">Le Séminaire</h1>

      <p class="sm-subtitle">A working retreat for leadership groups.<br />November through March.</p>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>The best decisions a team ever makes rarely happen in a meeting room. They happen at dinner, on a walk, in the space between one conversation and the next.</p>

        <p>Le Séminaire is two to five days in Provence, off-season, with the people who matter most to what you are building. Twenty-two suites at Toile Blanche, a declared work of art run by three artist brothers. Working sessions at Fondation CAB, one of Europe's most serious spaces for minimal and conceptual art. Breakfast, lunch, and dinner taken seriously.</p>

        <p>No flip charts. No team-building exercises. No hotel conference wing. Just a small group of people, a remarkable place, and enough time to think properly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 02: How the Days Work ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--days">
    <div class="sm-container">

      <p class="sm-section-label">How the days work</p>
      <h2 class="sm-h2">The rhythm</h2>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>Mornings belong to the work. The group transfers to Fondation CAB by organised van, ten minutes from Toile Blanche. The space is yours for a half or full day, configured for the group's needs. Before the session begins, a brief introduction to the current exhibition from the foundation's team, for those who want it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-inline-image">
        <img
        src="/assets/images/guinguette/IMG_7092.jpg"
        alt="La Guinguette, lunch"
          loading="lazy"
          class="sm-img"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>Lunch is at La Guinguette. Sharing plates, Provençal produce, rosé if the afternoon allows it.</p>

        <p>Afternoons are unstructured. The village, the foundations, the pool if the season permits, the particular pleasure of doing nothing in a place that rewards attention.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-inline-image">
        <img
        src="/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_4849.jpg"
        alt="Le Restaurant, evening"
          loading="lazy"
          class="sm-img"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>Evenings are at Le Restaurant. On the first night, the Leroy Brothers join the apéritif.</p>
      </div>


    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 03: The Spaces ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--spaces">
    <div class="sm-container">

      <p class="sm-section-label">Where you meet. Where you stay.</p>

      <!-- CAB subsection -->
      <div class="sm-subsection">
        <div class="sm-inline-image">
          <img
        src="/assets/images/pools/IMG_3049.jpg"
        alt="Fondation CAB working space"
            loading="lazy"
            class="sm-img"
          />
        </div>

        <p class="sm-subsection-label">The meeting space</p>
        <h2 class="sm-h2">Fondation CAB</h2>

        <div class="sm-body-text">
          <p>Fondation CAB is a private foundation dedicated to minimal and conceptual art, five minutes on foot from the centre of Saint-Paul-de-Vence. Founded by Hubert Bonnet, it houses one of the most important collections of its kind in Europe.</p>

          <p>The working space is available for half or full day sessions, with seating for up to twenty-two. Natural light, architectural calm, and a current exhibition always visible to the group. The environment is not incidental to the work, it is part of it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sm-inline-image">
          <img
        src="/assets/images/art/IMG_4376.jpg"
        alt="Work from the CAB collection"
            loading="lazy"
            class="sm-img"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Toile Blanche subsection -->
      <div class="sm-subsection">
        <div class="sm-inline-image">
          <img
        src="/assets/images/theproperty/closingfullwidth.jpg"
        alt="Toile Blanche, Saint-Paul-de-Vence"
            loading="lazy"
            class="sm-img"
          />
        </div>

        <p class="sm-subsection-label">The accommodation</p>
        <h2 class="sm-h2">Toile Blanche</h2>

        <div class="sm-body-text">
          <p>Twenty-two suites across seven buildings on a property declared a conceptual artwork in 2026 by the Leroy Brothers, the artists who own and run it. Each suite is different. All have been designed to feel like a home rather than a hotel room.</p>

          <p>Two restaurants, three shared pools, and the Alpes-Maritimes in every direction.</p>

          <p>
            <a href="https://www.toileblanche.com" class="sm-inline-link">Full details at toileblanche.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 04: The Details ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--details">
    <div class="sm-container">

      <p class="sm-section-label">What is included</p>

      <div class="sm-includes">
        <p>Twenty-two suites available, minimum group of eight.</p>
        <p>Breakfast daily at Toile Blanche, always included.</p>
        <p>Lunch daily at La Guinguette.</p>
        <p>Dinner daily at Le Restaurant.</p>
        <p>Working sessions at Fondation CAB, half or full day.</p>
        <p>Morning exhibition introduction at CAB, for the group.</p>
        <p>Organised van transfers between Toile Blanche and CAB.</p>
        <p>One dinner joined by the Leroy Brothers.</p>
        <p>Concierge available throughout for individual needs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-rates-block">
        <p class="sm-section-label">Rates</p>
        <p class="sm-rate-line">From <em class="sm-rate-placeholder">À confirmer / To be confirmed</em> per person per night</p>

        <div class="sm-rates-supporting">
          <p>All meals included as above.</p>
          <p>Minimum three nights. Maximum five nights.</p>
          <p>Two nights by arrangement only.</p>
          <p>Groups of eight to twenty-two.</p>
          <p>November through March only.</p>
          <p>All bookings direct. No third-party platforms.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="mailto:seminaire@toileblanche.com" class="sm-cta">
          Write to us about Le Séminaire
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 05: Closing ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--closing">

    <div class="sm-closing-image">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/parallax1.jpg"
        alt="Provence, off-season"
        loading="lazy"
        class="sm-img"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="sm-container sm-container--closing">
      <div class="sm-closing-text">
        <p>Le Séminaire is not for every group. It is for the ones who understand that where you think changes what you think.</p>

        <p>If that is your team, write to us. We begin with a conversation about what you are working on and what you need the week to produce. Everything else follows from there.</p>

        <a href="mailto:seminaire@toileblanche.com" class="sm-closing-email">
          seminaire@toileblanche.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

</SeminaireLayout>

<style>
  /* ─── Seminaire page layout ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Shared container: max 680px, centred, horizontal padding on mobile */
  .sm-container {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-left: var(--space-section-x);
    padding-right: var(--space-section-x);
  }

  /* Sections — consistent 80px top/bottom throughout */
  .sm-section {
    padding-top: var(--space-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  /* Premise starts with hero image above the container, no top padding needed */
  .sm-section--premise {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  /* Closing starts with a full-width image outside the container */
  .sm-section--closing {
    padding-top: 0;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  /* ─── Images ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Full-content-column images */
  .sm-hero-image {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .sm-inline-image {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .sm-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    object-fit: cover;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-warm);
  }

  .sm-hero-image .sm-img {
    max-height: 60vh;
  }

  /* ─── Typography ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Eyebrow / small-caps labels */
  .sm-eyebrow,
  .sm-section-label,
  .sm-subsection-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--color-stone-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
  }

  .sm-section-label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* H1: Heebo Regular, uppercase, tracked */
  .sm-h1 {
    font-family: 'Heebo', var(--font-body);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wider);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--color-ink-deep);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* H2: Gilda Display, 1.5 line-height */
  .sm-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ink-deep);
    margin: var(--space-1) 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  /* Subtitle: Gilda Display italic */
  .sm-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-stone);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  /* Body text */
  .sm-body-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  /* ─── Day rhythm block ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .sm-day-rhythm {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .sm-day-rhythm p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-normal);
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin: 0;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-faint);
  }

  .sm-day-rhythm p:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .sm-subsection {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .sm-subsection:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sm-subsection-label {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  /* Inline link */
  .sm-inline-link {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-terracotta-30);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sm-inline-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-deep);
  }

  /* ─── Details section ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Includes: plain stacked lines, no markers */
  .sm-includes {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .sm-includes p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-faint);
  }

  .sm-includes p:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Rates block: shaded olive tint */
  .sm-rates-block {
    background-color: rgba(173, 180, 160, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .sm-rate-line {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    color: var(--color-ink-deep);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .sm-rate-placeholder {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
  }

  .sm-rates-supporting {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .sm-rates-supporting p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-stone);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
  }

  /* CTA button */
  .sm-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-normal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-bg);
    background-color: var(--color-terracotta);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sm-cta:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-terracotta-deep);
  }

  /* ─── Closing section ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .sm-closing-image {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-left: var(--space-section-x);
    padding-right: var(--space-section-x);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .sm-container--closing {
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .sm-closing-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .sm-closing-email {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sm-closing-email:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-deep);
  }
</style>
